# Checked English-like numerical predicates.
let value be minus 4.
assert value is negative.
assert value is not positive.
assert 0 is zero.
assert 0.0 is zero.
assert 7 is positive.
assert 7 is odd.
assert 8 is even.
assert 9 is not even.
assert 12 is not negative.
assert 3.25 is positive.
when value is negative and 10 is even then:
    print "Natural numeric predicates OK".
end.
